WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.583
Owner’s site photograph. The white cottage and its awning sit beneath mature trees in the Mulanthuruthy compound.

2
00:00:03.583 --> 00:00:06.917
Design concept. Morning sunlight falls across garden seating in front of the cottage and bamboo.

3
00:00:06.917 --> 00:00:10.250
Design concept. A baker opens the compact oven and draws out a tray of golden pastry shells.

4
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.583
Design concept. A sliced pain au chocolat reveals two chocolate cores beside a steel tumbler of filter coffee.

5
00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:16.917
Design concept. A red sleeve opens to show four chocolate and cardamom éclairs, each in a paper liner.

6
00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:20.250
Design concept. A small croissant, choux puff and savoury pinwheel fill a three-part tasting tray under the bamboo.

7
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.583
Design concept. Guests pass pastries and glasses of tea across a garden table.

8
00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:26.917
Design concept. A guitarist plays to a small seated audience by the studio’s framed photograph and camera.

9
00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:30.500
Design concept. Guests gather beneath a warmly lit awning for a small evening celebration outside the cottage.
